#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__amount_before
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the source detail line's billed amount at the moment it was "
"selected, filled automatically by onchange. Never changes afterwards, even "
"if the source detail's own amount is later modified -- this is what keeps "
"this line a reliable trace of where the amount moved from."
msgstr ""
"Cuplikan jumlah tagihan baris detail sumber pada saat dipilih, terisi otomatis oleh onchange. Tidak berubah setelahnya, meskipun jumlah detail sumber itu sendiri diubah kemudian -- inilah yang menjadikan baris ini jejak yang andal tentang asal jumlah yang dipindahkan."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
