msgstr "Jumlah total yang dipindahkan oleh setiap baris dokumen ini."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__academic_term_id
msgid "The academic term of the enrollment."
msgstr "Periode akademik dari pendaftaran."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__academic_year_id
msgid "The academic year of the enrollment."
msgstr "Tahun ajaran dari pendaftaran."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__currency_id
msgid "The billing currency, taken from the enrollment."
msgstr "Mata uang penagihan, diambil dari pendaftaran."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__currency_id
msgid "The billing currency, taken from the transfer document."
msgstr "Mata uang penagihan, diambil dari dokumen transfer."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__destination_detail_id
msgid ""
"The fee line created on the Destination Term to hold the moved amount. Left "
"empty by this item -- it is only filled once the actual transfer is applied,"
" added by a later item in this repository."
msgstr ""
"Baris biaya yang dibuat pada Termin Tujuan untuk menampung jumlah yang dipindahkan. Dibiarkan kosong oleh item ini -- baru terisi setelah transfer sebenarnya diterapkan, yang ditambahkan oleh item berikutnya di repositori ini."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__line_ids
msgid "The individual fee lines being moved by this transfer."
msgstr "Baris-baris biaya yang dipindahkan oleh transfer ini."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__enrollment_id
msgid ""
"The open enrollment whose billed amount is being moved between payment "
"terms. Must be set for a document whose billing source is not otherwise "
"resolved -- enforced by ``_check_source_document``, not by this field "
"itself, so an extension module's own billing source is not forced to also be"
" a required field. Source Term/Destination Term requiredness is not yet "
"enforced here; that follows in a later item."
msgstr ""
"Pendaftaran terbuka yang jumlah tagihannya dipindahkan antar termin pembayaran. Harus diisi untuk dokumen yang sumber penagihannya tidak ditentukan dengan cara lain -- ditegakkan oleh ``_check_source_document``, bukan oleh field ini sendiri, sehingga sumber penagihan milik modul ekstensi tidak dipaksa menjadi field wajib. Kewajiban pengisian Termin Sumber/Termin Tujuan belum ditegakkan di sini; hal itu menyusul pada item berikutnya."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__source_detail_id
msgid ""
"The original fee line the amount is being moved from. Selecting it fills "
"Amount Before automatically. Required when the owning document's Source Type"
" is Enrollment -- enforced by ``_check_source_detail``, not by this field "
"itself, so an extension module's own source detail is not forced to also be "
"a required field."
msgstr ""
"Baris biaya asal tempat jumlah dipindahkan. Memilihnya akan mengisi Jumlah Sebelum secara otomatis. Wajib diisi bila Jenis Sumber dokumen pemiliknya adalah Pendaftaran -- ditegakkan oleh ``_check_source_detail``, bukan oleh field ini sendiri, sehingga detail sumber milik modul ekstensi tidak dipaksa menjadi field wajib."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__destination_term_id
msgid ""
"The payment term the amount is being moved into. Not yet enforced as "
"required here -- that follows in a later item; the Confirm/Done "
"prerequisites in ``_check_transfer_prerequisites`` still require it."
msgstr ""
"Termin pembayaran tujuan pemindahan jumlah. Belum ditegakkan sebagai wajib di sini -- hal itu menyusul pada item berikutnya; prasyarat Konfirmasi/Selesai di ``_check_transfer_prerequisites`` tetap mewajibkannya."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__source_term_id
msgid ""
"The payment term the amount is being moved out of. Not yet enforced as "
"required here -- that follows in a later item; the Confirm/Done "
"prerequisites in ``_check_transfer_prerequisites`` still require it."
msgstr ""
"Termin pembayaran asal pemindahan jumlah. Belum ditegakkan sebagai wajib di sini -- hal itu menyusul pada item berikutnya; prasyarat Konfirmasi/Selesai di ``_check_transfer_prerequisites`` tetap mewajibkannya."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__transfer_id
msgid "The payment term transfer document that owns this line."
msgstr "Dokumen transfer termin pembayaran yang memiliki baris ini."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__amount
msgid "The portion of Amount Before being moved to the destination term."
msgstr "Bagian dari Jumlah Sebelum yang dipindahkan ke termin tujuan."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__product_id
msgid "The product of the source detail line, shown for reference."
msgstr "Produk dari baris detail sumber, ditampilkan sebagai acuan."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__student_id
msgid "The student being billed, taken from the enrollment."
msgstr "Siswa yang ditagih, diambil dari pendaftaran."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__amount_total
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.school_payment_term_transfer_view_tree
msgid "Total"
msgstr "Total"

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer__name
msgid ""
"Transaction/document number\n"
"\n"
"* Unique indentifer of transaction\n"
"* Leave '/' to automatically generate number\n"
"* Change '/' into any number/identifier to manually assign number.\n"
"  Manual number assignment can be done in 'Draft' state\n"
"  Only user with 'Can Manualy Assign Number' policy can manually assign number.\n"
"* Transaction with number other than '/' can not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nomor transaksi/dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengenal unik transaksi\n"
"* Biarkan '/' untuk menghasilkan nomor secara otomatis\n"
"* Ubah '/' menjadi nomor/pengenal apa pun untuk menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"  Penetapan nomor manual dapat dilakukan dalam status 'Draf'\n"
"  Hanya pengguna dengan kebijakan 'Dapat Memasukkan Nomor Dokumen Manual' yang dapat menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"* Transaksi dengan nomor selain '/' tidak dapat dihapus."

#. module: ssi_school_payment_term_transfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_payment_term_transfer.field_school_payment_term_transfer_line__transfer_id
